---
import Layout from "../layouts/MyLayout.astro";
import Grid from "../components/Grid.astro";
---

<Layout title="The LOFT on King Street">
  <!-- <p class="text-blue-500 underline">
    <a
      href="https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vRQpvC-MJ656ITRHD6F2u3myYdcRkF7yAtrhtn4mGjgn-mOQCoEgpApA503roSdpdZgAnULX133bZ_I/pub?start=true&loop=false&delayms=3000"
      >See slideshow here</a
    > -->

  <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-purple-500 py-4">
    Enjoy the comfort of Santa Cruz living in the cozy loft!
  </h3>
  <ul class="list-disc mb-6 list-outside ml-4">
    <li class="mb-2">
      High ceilings and plenty of natural light for an open and inviting feel.
    </li>
    <li class="mb-2">
      Convenient mudroom with washer, dryer, and storage for easy beach gear and
      laundry management.
    </li>
    <li class="mb-2">
      Walking distance to downtown Santa Cruz for great dining and shopping
      opportunities.
    </li>
    <li class="mb-2">
      Just 1.5 miles away from beaches, wharf, and boardwalk for a day of sun
      and fun.
    </li>
    <li class="mb-2">
      Choose between separate sleeping areas upstairs or downstairs.
    </li>
    <li class="mb-2">
      Enjoy the privacy of your own separate, freestanding unit.
    </li>
    <li class="mb-2">
      Stay connected with complimentary Wi-Fi throughout the property.
    </li>
    <li class="mb-2">
      Relax in the newly renovated bathroom with a deep soaker bathtub and
      shower.
    </li>
    <li class="mb-2">
      Flexible dining options with a kitchen table or peninsula in the open
      floor plan.
    </li>
    <li class="mb-2">
      Surrounding tall trees provide a peaceful atmosphere on the patio.
    </li>
    <!-- <li class="mb-2">Healthcare facilities nearby:
      <ul>
        <li class="mb-2">Sutter/PAMF Urgent Care Westside: 0.6 miles away.</li>
        <li class="mb-2">Santa Cruz Main Clinic: 2.5 miles away.</li>
        <li class="mb-2">Dominican Hospital: 4 miles away.</li>
      </ul>
    </li> -->
  </ul>
  <p class="mb-2 text-2xl font-bold">Reach out to us to schedule a tour!</p>
  <p class="mb-2">
    Fill out the form below, or call/text Matt at (831) 275-2566
  </p>
  <form
    name="contact"
    netlify
    class="max-w-md p-6 mb-12 bg-white shadow-md rounded-lg"
  >
    <p class="mb-4">
      <label class="block text-gray-700 font-semibold mb-2">
        Name
        <input
          type="text"
          name="name"
          class="w-full p-2 border border-gray-300 rounded focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500"
        />
      </label>
    </p>
    <p class="mb-4">
      <label class="block text-gray-700 font-semibold mb-2">
        Email
        <input
          type="email"
          name="email"
          class="w-full p-2 border border-gray-300 rounded focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500"
        />
      </label>
    </p>
    <p>
      <button
        type="submit"
        class="w-full bg-violet-600 text-white py-2 px-4 font-bold rounded-full hover:bg-red-700 transition text-lg"
      >
        Send
      </button>
    </p>
  </form>

  <a
    href="/application.pdf"
    class="inline-block px-12 py-2 bg-violet-600 text-white font-bold text-lg rounded-full my-8 hover:bg-red-700 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300"
  >
    Download application
  </a>
  <Grid />
</Layout>
